    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Jump Servos are a repulsorlift-aided system that assists in making long jumps. When wearing Armor with this Upgrade, you treat all jumps as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Running_Jumps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Running Jumps\">Running Jumps</a>. Additionally, you can reroll a failed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> check (keeping the better of the two results) and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Take_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Take 10\">Take 10</a> on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> checks even when rushed or threatened. </p>",
